# Traffic Object Detection Dataset

## About the Project

This is a small image annotation project created to practice data annotation using CVAT.

The images contain common traffic and road objects. Each object was labelled using bounding boxes in CVAT.

## Tools Used

- CVAT
- COCO 1.0 Annotation Format

## Classes

The following objects were annotated:

- Car
- Bus
- Truck
- Motorcycle
- Person

## Annotation Method

Bounding Box Annotation was mainly used to identify and label objects in the images.

The annotations were exported in COCO 1.0 format and are available in the `annotations` folder.

## Dataset Structure

```text
Traffic-Object-Detection-Dataset/
├── images/
├── annotations/
